2026-11-08T16:18:31.6479788Z [36;1m# Within a full plan, evaluate both dry and live runs so block-only drift[0m
2026-11-08T16:18:31.6480234Z [36;1m# participates in has_changes and PR creation.[0m
2026-11-08T16:18:31.6480575Z [36;1mimport sys[0m
